  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PILOT PROGRAM TO INITIATE FISCAL DECENTRALIZATION PROCESS IN SURINAME, WITH THREE COMPONENTS: (1) ENNABLING LEGISLATION FOR FISCAL EMPOWERMENT OF DISTRICT GOVERNMENTS, (2) CORE CAPACITY BUILDING OF 4 PILOT DISTRICTS, AND (3) PROGRAM MANAGEMENT.</narrative>
